            "value": "Apps"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apps and their data use %@. %@ of it is caches and logs that apps rebuild on their own.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apps und ihre Daten belegen %@. Davon sind %@ Caches und Protokolle, die Apps selbst wieder anlegen."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "Apps and their data use %1$@. %2$@ of it is caches and logs that apps rebuild on their own."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apps appear here while they play sound.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apps erscheinen hier, während sie Ton abspielen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apps are asked to quit first, so you can save open documents.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apps werden zuerst gebeten, sich zu beenden, damit du offene Dokumente sichern kannst."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apps during this session": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apps während dieser Aufnahme"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apps need more memory than this Mac has, so macOS compresses memory and moves it to the disk (swap). Switching apps and tabs gets slow.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die Apps brauchen mehr Speicher, als dieser Mac hat. macOS komprimiert deshalb Speicher und lagert ihn auf die Festplatte aus (Swap). Der Wechsel zwischen Apps und Tabs wird langsam."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apps now": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apps jetzt"
          }
        }
